  "boundaries": [
    "The direct representative becomes delivered after IPC acceptance; a room clears its dispatch-flight map. Neither earlier callback can authorize the later asynchronous pane write.",
    "Each actual adapter supplies a separate final-input callback after durable intent, bound to the exact question/dispatch, source link, consent and agent lifecycle. Missing proof and answered/stale/replaced resources refuse.",
    "The real signed representative, final resolver, B store and C bind succeed after the pre-send fence ends. Closed owners return false without touching a closed database or retaining dead references.",
